# Brand Design Colour Palette Guidelines
## Feisal Ahmed — Agent Engineer Portfolio

> Extracted from moodboard reference: `folly.png`

---

## 🎨 Colour Palette

The palette is a **6-swatch gradient system** moving from light neutrals to deep navy blues, evoking a **professional, architectural, alpine** aesthetic.

| Swatch | Hex Code    | RGB               | HSL                    | Role               |
|--------|-------------|-------------------|------------------------|---------------------|
| 1      | `#F0F0EE`   | `rgb(240,240,238)` | `hsl(60, 5%, 94%)`    | **Lightest / Background** |
| 2      | `#DBDBDB`   | `rgb(219,219,219)` | `hsl(0, 0%, 86%)`     | **Light Neutral / Borders** |
| 3      | `#4A5262`   | `rgb(74, 82, 98)`  | `hsl(220, 14%, 34%)`  | **Mid-tone / Subtext** |
| 4      | `#7A899B`   | `rgb(122,137,155)` | `hsl(213, 14%, 54%)`  | **Accent / Secondary** |
| 5      | `#506383`   | `rgb(80, 99, 131)` | `hsl(218, 24%, 41%)`  | **Primary Blue / Interactive** |
| 6      | `#2E4160`   | `rgb(46, 65, 96)`  | `hsl(217, 35%, 28%)`  | **Deepest / Headings & CTA** |

---

## 🔤 Typography

### Font Families

| Role            | Font Stack                              |
|-----------------|-----------------------------------------|
| **Display**     | `'Space Grotesk', 'Inter', sans-serif`  |
| **Body**        | `'Inter', sans-serif`                   |

### Weights

| Weight          | Value  | Usage                          |
|-----------------|--------|--------------------------------|
| **Light**       | 300    | Body text, captions            |
| **Regular**     | 400    | General body, links            |
| **Medium**      | 500    | Subheadings, emphasis          |
| **Semi-Bold**   | 600    | Section headings               |
| **Bold**        | 700    | Hero display, CTAs, headings   |

### Type Usage Rules

| Element             | Font           | Weight    | Colour     | Notes                              |
|---------------------|----------------|-----------|------------|-------------------------------------|
| Hero / Display      | Space Grotesk  | Bold 700  | `#F0F0EE`  | White-on-dark, overlaid on imagery  |
| Section Headings    | Space Grotesk  | SemiBold 600 | `#2E4160` | Deep navy, commanding presence      |
| Subheadings         | Space Grotesk  | Medium 500 | `#4A5262` | Mid-tone slate for hierarchy        |
| Body Text           | Inter          | Regular 400 | `#4A5262` | Comfortable reading on light bg     |
| Captions / Meta     | Inter          | Light 300 | `#7A899B`  | Subdued secondary information       |
| Links / Interactive | Inter          | Regular 400 | `#506383` | Primary blue, underline on hover    |

---

## 🎯 Colour Roles & Semantic Usage

### Backgrounds
| Context              | Colour     | Notes                         |
|----------------------|------------|-------------------------------|
| Page Background      | `#F0F0EE`  | Warm off-white, not pure `#FFF` |
| Card / Surface       | `#FFFFFF`  | Pure white for elevated cards  |
| Muted Section        | `#DBDBDB`  | Light grey for alternating sections |
| Dark Section / Hero  | `#2E4160`  | Deep navy for contrast blocks  |
| Frame / Accent Block | `#333333`  | Near-black (from "Frame" element) |

### Foreground / Text
| Context              | Colour     |
|----------------------|------------|
| Primary Text         | `#4A5262`  |
| Secondary Text       | `#7A899B`  |
| Headings             | `#2E4160`  |
| Inverted Text (dark bg) | `#F0F0EE` |

### Interactive Elements
| State                | Colour     |
|----------------------|------------|
| Default              | `#506383`  |
| Hover                | `#2E4160`  |
| Active / Pressed     | `#4A5262`  |
| Disabled             | `#DBDBDB`  |

### Borders & Dividers
| Context              | Colour     |
|----------------------|------------|
| Subtle Divider       | `#DBDBDB`  |
| Active Border        | `#7A899B`  |
| Focus Ring           | `#506383`  |

---

## 🌗 Contrast Ratios (WCAG 2.1)

| Pair                                  | Ratio   | AA (Normal) | AA (Large) |
|---------------------------------------|---------|-------------|------------|
| `#2E4160` on `#F0F0EE`               | ~8.5:1  | ✅ Pass     | ✅ Pass    |
| `#4A5262` on `#F0F0EE`               | ~5.8:1  | ✅ Pass     | ✅ Pass    |
| `#506383` on `#F0F0EE`               | ~4.5:1  | ✅ Pass     | ✅ Pass    |
| `#7A899B` on `#F0F0EE`               | ~3.0:1  | ❌ Fail     | ✅ Pass    |
| `#F0F0EE` on `#2E4160`               | ~8.5:1  | ✅ Pass     | ✅ Pass    |

> [!WARNING]
> `#7A899B` on `#F0F0EE` fails AA for normal text. Use only for large text (18px+), captions, or decorative elements.

