## 🖼️ Visual Motifs & Imagery

Extracted from the moodboard:

| Motif               | Description                                                |
|---------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Architecture**    | Urban skyscrapers, glass/steel, shot from low angles, warm amber tones |
| **Alpine / Nature** | Mountain peaks with clouds, cool blue/grey tones, atmospheric depth |
| **Colour Treatment**| Desaturated, muted — imagery should feel editorial and refined, never saturated or cartoonish |
| **Overlay Style**   | Bold white typography overlaid directly on photography with slight transparency or shadow for legibility |

