## 🤖 LLM-Ready Prompt Block

Copy the block below directly into any LLM prompt to enforce brand consistency:

```
BRAND DESIGN SYSTEM — FEISAL AHMED WEB PORTFOLIO

COLOUR PALETTE (ordered light → dark):
1. #F0F0EE — Background / Lightest (warm off-white)
2. #DBDBDB — Borders / Light Neutral
3. #7A899B — Captions / Secondary Accent (use 18px+ only on light bg)
4. #4A5262 — Body Text / Mid-tone Slate
5. #506383 — Primary Blue / Interactive Elements
6. #2E4160 — Headings / CTA / Deep Navy

TYPOGRAPHY:
- Display Font: Space Grotesk (Google Fonts) — headings, hero text, CTAs
- Body Font: Inter (Google Fonts) — body text, captions, links
- Display stack: 'Space Grotesk', 'Inter', sans-serif
- Body stack: 'Inter', sans-serif
- Weights: Light (300), Regular (400), Medium (500), SemiBold (600), Bold (700)
- Hero overlay: Space Grotesk Bold 700 in #F0F0EE on dark imagery
- Section headings: Space Grotesk SemiBold 600 in #2E4160
- Subheadings: Space Grotesk Medium 500 in #4A5262
- Body: Inter Regular 400 in #4A5262
- Captions: Inter Light 300 in #7A899B

DESIGN RULES:
- Never use pure white (#FFFFFF) as page background; use #F0F0EE
- Imagery should be desaturated / editorial — urban architecture or alpine nature
- Typography on images: bold white with subtle text-shadow for legibility
- Interactive elements default to #506383, darken to #2E4160 on hover
- Maintain minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio for body text (WCAG AA)
- Use #333333 for accent dark blocks / frames
- Palette is cool-toned; avoid warm accent colours (no oranges, reds, yellows)
```

